{"id": "EUVD-2026-95030", "enisaUuid": "0c196397-b644-3949-b653-94d23e7002c7", "description": "The `insights-operator-gather` ClusterRole grants the operator's service account read access to secrets in the core API group with no namespace or resourceNames restriction \u2014 therefore, access to every secret in every namespace in the cluster.\n\nRef: https://github.com/openshift/insights-operator/blob/8f15e3157ff09f54ab22801f5b21da35a195cc6d/manifests/03-clusterrole.yaml#L368-L373\n```\n- apiGroups:\n  - \"\"\n  resources:\n  - secrets\n  verbs:\n  - get\n  - list\n```\n\nBy spawning a pod with the gather service account mounted, an attacker will be able to access any secret in any namespace.\n\n```\nspec:\n serviceAccountName:\"gather\"\n```", "datePublished": "2026-10-08T14:31:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T05:09:29", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82785", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82813", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83480", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83502", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83702", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-93017", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2515741"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-93017", "GHSA-97xr-6xrj-3f39"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "45a69df3-eaaa-37af-82d8-5d4ce96cfda1", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.19", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1791626249"}, {"id": "7f13aead-7f48-3763-8e46-b8c22752cc24", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.15", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1791632611"}, {"id": "7fb6c532-7ad3-3bd8-b4fb-d5b403fcacc1", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.14", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1791842870"}, {"id": "837e1410-5d00-3cf9-aa24-3a3162d72b22", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.21", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1791980436"}, {"id": "86729784-6df3-3d5e-bdcd-e3f0e5ae4650", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.20", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1791625576"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a3be57bb-421b-30b7-81fb-323b9589f922", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}], "isExploited": false}